WEBVTT

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:07.070
From now on, my work in the café
would get a bit easier.

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:08.860
Ichigo, there’s an alien!

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:10.070
Huh?

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:11.700
There’s an alien!

00:00:12.730 --> 00:00:13.700
It’s true!

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:19.160
We just wanted to check out those who will oppose our plans.

00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:21.120
But I kinda like you!

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:39.000
How come? Why did that guy
suddenly kiss me?

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.310
Ichigo, is something the matter?

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:45.560
Could it be a fever?

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:46.900
Your face is all red.

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:48.570
Ichigo!

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:52.280
Oh it’s nothing, nothing really…

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:55.200
Oh, Aoyama-kun!

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:57.950
Aoyama-kun!

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:02.250
Aoyama-kun.

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:03.660
Morning.

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:06.990
Morning.

00:01:06.990 --> 00:01:08.170
Good morning.

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:11.840
Wait, Ichigo!

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:17.920
What’s wrong with Ichigo?

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:19.390
She’s acting weird.

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:22.090
What do I do?

00:01:22.090 --> 00:01:24.610
I can’t face Aoyama-kun now.

00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:41.910
Err… it’s Aoyama-kun…!

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:02.840
We don’t meet this often,

00:02:02.840 --> 00:02:05.640
but now I’m too ashamed to face him.

00:02:12.600 --> 00:02:15.150
Hurry up! We’ll miss kendo practice.

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:16.900
Wait for me, wait for me!

00:02:28.450 --> 00:02:31.080
I want to see him too…!

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:33.090
What should I do?

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:34.760
Mamomiya-san?

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:38.180
Aoyama-kun!

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:41.760
You don’t look very well today…

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:42.850
Do you feel sick?

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:46.050
It’s not that, Aoyama-kun.

00:02:46.050 --> 00:02:49.600
Please don’t look at me with those kind eyes.

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:52.220
I-It’s nothing.

00:02:52.220 --> 00:02:53.810
I’m feeling great!

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:56.230
That’s good, here…

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:04.900
There’s going to be a chance to spend time with animals in Nishiyama Park tomorrow.

00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:06.330
Shall we go together?

00:03:07.260 --> 00:03:08.540
<i>Shall we go together?</i>

00:03:11.910 --> 00:03:15.830
YES!! Aoyama asked me out!

00:03:15.830 --> 00:03:19.430
It’s a date! A date! ALRIGHT!!

00:03:20.650 --> 00:03:21.340
Thanks for the kiss.

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:28.090
I’m sorry, Aoyama-kun…

00:03:28.090 --> 00:03:30.640
I’m kind of busy tomorrow, I can’t go.

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:32.060
I see.

00:03:34.140 --> 00:03:35.360
I’m sorry.

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:44.910
Quiche.

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:45.670
Yes.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:49.790
Have you gathered the data for the plan?

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:53.170
I am doing it right now.

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:58.500
For 56 million years, it’s been crowded with these lower life forms…

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:01.290
Then, I will continue my work.

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:02.260
Quiche!

00:04:03.460 --> 00:04:06.510
Our planet and the earth…

00:04:06.510 --> 00:04:09.770
with all these species of animals

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:12.730
…must be brought to submission quickly.

00:04:19.730 --> 00:04:22.070
Ichigo, please get a hold of yourself!

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:23.440
Ichigo!

00:04:23.440 --> 00:04:24.650
What is it?

00:04:24.650 --> 00:04:27.410
What do you mean “what is it”? Look!

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:32.160
Do you plan to break all the dishes here?

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:33.890
That’s not good, Retasu.

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:34.790
You shouldn’t do that!

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:39.250
I didn’t do it, it was you, Ichigo-san!

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:43.220
And… I’m sure my heart
is broken tooooo!

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:45.630
What’s wrong with Ichigo-san?

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:48.930
Who knows…? She’s falling apart.

00:04:48.930 --> 00:04:50.720
Did something happen?

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:56.430
I was supposed to go on a date with Aoyama-kun,

00:04:56.430 --> 00:04:57.900
but I can’t now!

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:02.980
I’m sure you shouldn’t be acting like that, right?

00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:04.450
He’ll dislike it.

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:07.400
Yeah… it’s DIFFERENT!

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:09.910
There’s a different reason
why I can’t go!

00:05:10.400 --> 00:05:11.830
Then what happened?

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:14.660
I… I got kissed by a stranger.

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:16.740
No… It’s nothing.

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:18.670
Back to work, back to work!

00:05:29.190 --> 00:05:32.130
Ichigo really wanted to go
on her date.

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:34.850
She didn’t eat the cake too.

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:46.990
The others are done already.

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:49.610
Hey!

00:05:49.610 --> 00:05:53.160
Instead of daydreaming on your free time, go and look for aliens!

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:55.620
Let’s go, Ichigo! Let’s go, Ichigo!

00:05:57.910 --> 00:06:00.200
Get going already.

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:03.210
Just when a cute girl is down!

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:03.670
Ogre!!

00:06:03.670 --> 00:06:04.720
DEVIL!!!

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:17.310
How could he order me around when I’m this troubled…

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:19.850
Ichigo, not that way,
this way, this way, this way!

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:21.060
Masha, what’s wrong?

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:22.440
Could it be… a Chimera Anima?

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:27.860
This way, this way!

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:41.420
This way, this way!

00:06:43.160 --> 00:06:44.510
<i>Next stop.</i>

00:06:49.920 --> 00:06:52.310
Masha, where are we going?

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:57.180
Ichigo, hurry up! Ichigo, hurry up!

00:06:57.180 --> 00:06:58.310
Sigh.

00:07:04.060 --> 00:07:05.900
Ichigo, come here.

00:07:08.310 --> 00:07:09.820
This place!?

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:18.960
Masha, I’m happy but I…

00:07:21.540 --> 00:07:22.950
Ichigo, look! Ichigo, look!

00:07:22.950 --> 00:07:25.210
I already turned him down…

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:27.920
Aoyama-kun!

00:07:28.250 --> 00:07:29.290
Momomiya-san.

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:31.090
I knew you’ll come.

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:33.090
Umm, yeah…

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:35.180
I’ve waited awhile for you…

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:41.100
Oh… I can’t stand it anymore!

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:43.310
I just have to forget that kiss!

00:07:45.390 --> 00:07:46.150
Let’s go!

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:01.660
I wonder how Ichigo-san is doing?

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:05.960
Probably still crying her eyes out
about that date…

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:26.520
That looks like the place to spend time with the animals.

00:08:27.350 --> 00:08:30.820
Seems like the special animal today is a lion cub.

00:08:31.980 --> 00:08:33.200
It looks like fun.

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:37.160
I’m so happy! I’m on a date with Aoyama-kun!

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:40.910
We still have time…

00:08:40.910 --> 00:08:42.620
Shall we visit the other attractions?

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:43.480
Yes!

00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:44.370
What do you want to see?

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:49.130
That one!

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:50.500
That one?

00:08:53.540 --> 00:08:54.920
I didn’t look while saying it!

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:56.880
I’m petrified of haunted houses.

00:08:56.880 --> 00:09:00.180
Eh, I didn’t know you like those kind of stuff.

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:04.270
Aoyama-kun…

00:09:04.760 --> 00:09:05.940
What to do…?

00:09:23.300 --> 00:09:25.620
Ummm… For real?

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:35.280
Momomiya-san, look!

00:09:53.290 --> 00:09:54.650
I’m scared!

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:57.820
But I think I’m getting used to this.

00:10:05.220 --> 00:10:06.520
I’m sorry!

00:10:07.050 --> 00:10:08.430
Are you ok?

00:10:08.430 --> 00:10:10.080
Yep, somehow…

00:10:10.390 --> 00:10:13.960
Gosh… There goes my special date!

00:10:17.990 --> 00:10:18.990
Let’s go.

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:37.840
Aoyama-kun?

00:10:49.510 --> 00:10:52.460
Everything is gone…

00:10:56.310 --> 00:10:58.610
DIE…

00:11:00.190 --> 00:11:02.820
That’s it, it’s too much…

00:11:04.440 --> 00:11:05.900
Momomiya-san!

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:07.910
Hang in there, Momomiya-san!

00:11:11.160 --> 00:11:12.350
Aoyama-kun?

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:14.120
Thank goodness…

00:11:14.120 --> 00:11:15.790
You didn’t hit your head?

00:11:15.790 --> 00:11:21.510
Aoyama-kun is so kind and reliable…
This will be such a cute memory -nya!

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:24.920
S-Sorry!

00:11:24.920 --> 00:11:26.160
Shall we go?

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:32.310
He’s holding my hand…

00:11:34.930 --> 00:11:39.190
It’s alright. Everyone please… calm down…

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:42.650
I wonder what happened?

00:11:42.650 --> 00:11:44.600
The animals are acting strange.

00:11:50.280 --> 00:11:51.610
This feeling…

00:11:51.610 --> 00:11:52.980
It’s an alien!

00:11:53.870 --> 00:11:55.020
It can’t be…!

00:11:56.370 --> 00:12:00.040
You shouldn’t go on a date with another guy.

00:12:00.040 --> 00:12:01.990
Cause you’re mine…

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:09.060
This is bad, Momomiya-san,
let’s escape!

00:12:09.060 --> 00:12:09.630
But…

00:12:09.630 --> 00:12:10.410
Hurry!

00:12:14.140 --> 00:12:17.640
What do I do?
I want to be with Aoyama-kun…

00:12:17.640 --> 00:12:19.900
…but, I have to go.

00:12:26.570 --> 00:12:29.870
Momomiya-san!

00:12:33.410 --> 00:12:35.040
I’m sorry, Aoyama-kun…

00:12:35.570 --> 00:12:37.540
I don’t want to fight but…

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:41.160
Hehe, we meet again honey.

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:43.030
You!

00:12:44.710 --> 00:12:46.800
Thanks for the kiss that time.

00:12:47.340 --> 00:12:50.660
But now I’m hungry for more.

00:12:53.800 --> 00:12:55.550
What are you thinking?

00:12:55.550 --> 00:12:59.970
Oh yeah, you liked my kiss?

00:12:59.970 --> 00:13:01.770
How about one more?

00:13:02.600 --> 00:13:03.880
Stop kidding!!!

00:13:05.210 --> 00:13:06.840
As if I’d let you!?

00:13:08.670 --> 00:13:10.850
Tomboyish as always.

00:13:11.650 --> 00:13:13.640
Who are you exactly?

00:13:14.530 --> 00:13:17.250
I told you, my name is Quiche.

00:13:20.240 --> 00:13:21.440
That jellyfish…

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:24.820
You ready? I’m going to test your power.

00:13:25.330 --> 00:13:27.410
Go! Parasite-alien!

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:48.350
The cub became a Chimera Anima!

00:14:04.890 --> 00:14:09.210
I see, if you can’t transform,
you’re just a normal human.

00:14:09.210 --> 00:14:10.080
How disappointing.

00:14:10.420 --> 00:14:12.220
You’re the worst!

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:14.380
Really?

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:17.750
Well I’m finished here,
why don’t you just die now.

00:14:18.590 --> 00:14:21.210
What’s with this guy? He’s scary!

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:25.640
Too bad, just when I thought I found myself a cute toy.

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:29.110
But it’ll be a problem if I let you go.

00:14:30.560 --> 00:14:32.720
Bye bye Cat-ear-chan.

00:14:33.400 --> 00:14:34.180
I’m finished!

00:14:34.180 --> 00:14:35.910
Stop right there!

00:14:37.150 --> 00:14:40.650
Reborn Mint Echo!

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:47.440
Ahh you still have friends.

00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:51.580
Mew Mint! Mew Lettuce!

00:14:52.650 --> 00:14:55.500
Ichigo, what are you doing slacking off at work?

00:14:56.590 --> 00:14:57.800
What are you saying?!

00:14:57.800 --> 00:15:00.010
Really, cause this is Ichigo.

00:15:00.010 --> 00:15:05.600
What! You’re the one who’s always just drinking tea and not working!

00:15:05.600 --> 00:15:07.810
Oh yeah, how did you know I was here?

00:15:07.810 --> 00:15:12.020
I saw your ticket while you were gazing blankly at it.

00:15:12.020 --> 00:15:15.230
Shirogane-san told us to check on you.

00:15:15.230 --> 00:15:16.490
Shirogane did?

00:15:18.030 --> 00:15:21.060
Right, this is hardly the right time to talk!

00:15:21.060 --> 00:15:25.020
Anyway, we’ve to turn that Chimera Anima back to a baby cub.

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:27.530
Alright, it’s time to transform!

00:15:28.410 --> 00:15:32.880
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:16:09.750 --> 00:16:13.000
You! I don’t care whether you’re Quiche or Kiss.

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:16.300
But for stealing my innocence… I won’t forgive you!

00:16:16.300 --> 00:16:17.850
What’s that about?

00:16:18.800 --> 00:16:19.720
Nothing!

00:16:19.720 --> 00:16:20.850
Sounds fishy.

00:16:21.880 --> 00:16:26.600
For spoiling the fun of these people spending their time with animals…

00:16:28.180 --> 00:16:29.640
For the future of the Earth!

00:16:29.640 --> 00:16:31.260
At your service ~Nya!

00:16:32.350 --> 00:16:34.610
The other toys are also cute.

00:16:37.530 --> 00:16:38.640
It’s fast!

00:16:44.870 --> 00:16:47.080
We can’t just dodge it.

00:16:47.080 --> 00:16:51.440
Let’s split up and attack when it’s chasing one of us!

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:53.320
3, 2, 1…!

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:52.550
But…

00:16:57.040 --> 00:16:58.500
Why must it be me?

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:03.500
Not my tail!

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:05.500
Mew Strawberry!

00:17:06.050 --> 00:17:07.560
LettasTanets!

00:17:15.640 --> 00:17:20.980
Reborn… Lettuce RUSH!

00:17:25.160 --> 00:17:26.460
StrawberBell!

00:17:40.800 --> 00:17:44.580
Reborn Strawberry… CHECK!!

00:17:57.270 --> 00:17:57.940
Did it!

00:17:57.940 --> 00:17:58.860
We did it!

00:17:58.860 --> 00:18:00.100
Yep, right!

00:18:00.900 --> 00:18:02.570
They did it, huh?

00:18:02.570 --> 00:18:05.560
Oh well, that’s it for today,
I’m going home.

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:07.520
Don’t you ever come back.

00:18:12.040 --> 00:18:15.140
By the way, Ichigo-san,
how was the date?

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:16.670
Oh no!

00:18:19.720 --> 00:18:22.690
Geez, and not even a thank you.

00:18:22.690 --> 00:18:26.850
Ichigo-san is pretty absorbed when it comes to Aoyama-kun.

00:18:29.970 --> 00:18:32.380
Could Aoyama-kun have gone home already?

00:18:37.430 --> 00:18:38.690
Momomiya-san!

00:18:38.690 --> 00:18:40.430
Aoyama-kun!

00:18:42.690 --> 00:18:44.140
You came to look for me?

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:48.990
Aoyama-kun?

00:18:49.700 --> 00:18:51.620
What were you trying to do?!

00:18:55.790 --> 00:18:57.570
I’m sorry, I…

00:18:58.370 --> 00:19:03.030
What should I do?
I can’t tell him the real reason.

00:19:05.050 --> 00:19:07.370
Nevermind, let’s go.

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:14.640
I-It’s over…

00:19:14.640 --> 00:19:18.170
Aoyama-kun probably hates me now.

00:19:22.440 --> 00:19:23.690
Aoyama-kun…

00:19:34.120 --> 00:19:35.000
It’s okay.

00:19:36.580 --> 00:19:37.800
Aoyama-kun?

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:40.860
I was really worried.

00:19:42.420 --> 00:19:43.820
Let’s visit some other day.

00:19:49.580 --> 00:19:53.350
But next time don’t suddenly run off like that!

00:19:53.970 --> 00:19:55.190
Promise?

00:20:07.610 --> 00:20:13.160
Aoyama-kun, I still have a secret that I am hiding from you…

00:20:13.720 --> 00:20:17.160
…but these feelings are for real.

00:20:17.160 --> 00:20:21.090
Aoyama-kun, I love you
soo soo much!!

00:20:25.060 --> 00:20:27.730
Ehhh… I was scouted to be a gymnast?!

00:20:27.730 --> 00:20:32.250
I’d probably look good in a leotard, but I’ve never tried gymnastics before.

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:34.590
Ichigo! Here, bouncing ball!

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:37.320
Oh no, automatic reaction!

00:20:37.320 --> 00:20:39.010
Hola! Ribbon’s all twirled up!

00:20:39.010 --> 00:20:40.780
I can’t help it ~nya!

00:20:40.780 --> 00:20:43.990
These cat powers are acting on their own,
I can’t stop it ~nya!

00:20:42.140 --> 00:20:43.510
Twirl twirl!

00:20:43.990 --> 00:20:46.180
Nyaaa Minto stop it!!!

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:50.960
Next! Stormy Rhythmic Gymnastics:
Becoming a Star with a Cat’s dance!

00:20:50.960 --> 00:20:54.230
For the Earth’s future,
we’ll be of service ~nya!
